{
  "name": "Partner Operations Hub - One Record, Tier Activation, AI Deliverables",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - ONE PARTNER RECORD\n\nA partner changes in any one system and the same record updates everywhere else. No more typing the same fields into four tools.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "4064c257-5667-5235-9ef7-1c4f8d8faa82",
      "name": "Section - 1 - ONE PARTNER RECORD",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - ACTIVATION BY PARTNER TIER\n\nThe tier decides what happens next, from a full joint campaign task set down to an automated check-in.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ff8ae501-66e5-53d0-9a5b-1be58647fc21",
      "name": "Section - 2 - ACTIVATION BY PARTNER TIER",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - AI DELIVERABLES FROM YOUR OWN TEMPLATES\n\nClient inputs go in, a draft built on your framework comes out. Claude writes into your structure, never its own.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 1400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ac7a462a-4652-5b64-aee4-62bdd5bb6dd5",
      "name": "Section - 3 - AI DELIVERABLES FROM YOUR OWN TEMPLATES",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1660,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - REVIEW AND MEASURE\n\nA person approves every draft before it leaves, and each run logs the hours it saved so the value is visible.",
        "height": 1060,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "f05ed694-b248-5ecd-993e-559392f3a8da",
      "name": "Section - 4 - REVIEW AND MEASURE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3220,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - WHEN SOMETHING BREAKS\n\nA failed run pings the partner owner with a link straight to it. Nothing fails quietly.",
